eted version will be available in next week’s digital edition, offering a chance to verify solutions or seek hints. The grey-lined cells add a fresh dimension to the traditional format, making the puzzle appealing to both newcomers and experienced players. This twist ensures that no two playthroughs feel identical, even for those familiar with standard Sudoku.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.07623441517353058}, {"token": "Normal", "logprob": -0.5362018346786499}, {"token": " Sud", "logprob": -0.20681703090667725}, {"token": "oku", "logprob": -9.536697689327411e-06}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.28514212369918823}, {"token": " apply", "logprob": -0.8402061462402344}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.2200404405593872}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.5171505212783813}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20479074120521545}, {"token": " twist", "logprob": -0.761646568775177}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -1.5976004600524902}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.951621413230896}, {"token": " numbers", "logprob": -0.4475772976875305}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -1.033516526222229}, {"token": " cells", "logprob": -0.29212459921836853}, {"token": " outlined", "logprob": -0.28304535150527954}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.22315947711467743}, {"token": " grey", "logprob": -0.000920706195756793}, {"token": " must", "logprob": -0.020401980727910995}, {"token": " sum", "logprob": -0.7811212539672852}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.03811015188694}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0007544293766841292}, {"token": " small", "logprob": -1.2844887971878052}, {"token": " figures", "logprob": -0.5819048285484314}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.5660795569419861}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.08971405774354935}, {"token": " corners", "logprob": -0.3673383593559265}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -1.4301050901412964}, {"token": " those", "logprob": -0.029691748321056366}, {"token": " sections", "logprob": -0.3648472726345062}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.017950112000107765}, {"